  {
   "id": 14,
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "Zone DNS lookups/s",
   "description": "DNS queries per zone to dnsmasq (UDP/53 flows seen by the NAT table, so repeated queries on the same socket count once).\n\nIPv4 only; IPv6 traffic isn't counted per zone. `guest` (.5) has no counters. From the iptables exporter (scraped every 60s, so 3-minute rate).",
   "datasource": "Prometheus",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 8,
    "w": 6,
    "x": 18,
    "y": 12
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "sum(rate(iptables_packets{table=\"nat\",chain=\"PREROUTING\",rule=~\"-s_192\\\\.168\\\\.2\\\\.0/24_-p_udp_.*--dport_53_\"}[3m]))",
     "legendFormat": "green",
     "refId": "A"
    },
    {
     "expr": "sum(rate(iptables_packets{table=\"nat\",chain=\"PREROUTING\",rule=~\"-s_192\\\\.168\\\\.3\\\\.0/24_-p_udp_.*--dport_53_\"}[3m]))",
     "legendFormat": "kids",
     "refId": "B"
    },
    {
     "expr": "sum(rate(iptables_packets{table=\"nat\",chain=\"PREROUTING\",rule=~\"-s_192\\\\.168\\\\.4\\\\.0/24_-p_udp_.*--dport_53_\"}[3m]))",
     "legendFormat": "smarthome",
     "refId": "C"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short",
     "color": {
      "mode": "palette-classic"
     },
     "custom": {
      "drawStyle": "line",
      "lineWidth": 2,
      "fillOpacity": 10,
      "showPoints": "never",
      "spanNulls": true,
      "stacking": {
       "mode": "none",
       "group": "A"
      }
     },
     "min": 0
    },
    "overrides": [
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "green"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "color",
        "value": {
         "mode": "fixed",
         "fixedColor": "green"
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "kids"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "color",
        "value": {
         "mode": "fixed",
         "fixedColor": "blue"
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "smarthome"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "color",
        "value": {
         "mode": "fixed",
         "fixedColor": "purple"
        }
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "options": {
    "legend": {
     "displayMode": "table",
     "placement": "bottom",
     "showLegend": true,
     "calcs": [
      "max"
     ]
    },
    "tooltip": {
     "mode": "multi",
     "sort": "desc"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 15,
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "LAN download by device (stacked)",
   "description": "Download of every device on `lan`, one colour per device, stacked: the top of the stack is the total sent to all LAN devices, and the dashed **Total** line is the same sum. IPv4 + IPv6, counted per MAC by the nft `acct_lan` table (includes traffic from the router itself and between zones). Click a legend entry to isolate a device. For upload, per-zone and per-device filters, open **LAN Devices**.",
   "datasource": "Prometheus",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 10,
    "w": 24,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 20
   },
   "interval": "1m",
   "links": [
    {
     "title": "LAN Devices: filter by zone/device, upload",
     "url": "/d/lan-devices"
    }
   ],
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "sum by (name, mac) (rate(lan_device_download_bytes_total{tracked!=\"n/a\"}[3m])) * 8",
     "legendFormat": "{{name}}",
     "refId": "A"
    },
    {
     "expr": "sum(rate(lan_device_download_bytes_total{tracked!=\"n/a\"}[3m])) * 8",
     "legendFormat": "Total",
     "refId": "B"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "bps",
     "min": 0,
     "color": {
      "mode": "palette-classic"
     },
     "custom": {
      "drawStyle": "line",
      "lineWidth": 1,
      "fillOpacity": 70,
      "showPoints": "never",
      "spanNulls": true,
      "stacking": {
       "mode": "normal",
       "group": "A"
      }
     }
    },
    "overrides": [
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "Total"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "custom.stacking",
        "value": {
         "mode": "none",
         "group": "A"
        }
       },
       {
        "id": "custom.fillOpacity",
        "value": 0
       },
       {
        "id": "custom.lineWidth",
        "value": 2
       },
       {
        "id": "custom.lineStyle",
        "value": {
         "fill": "dash",
         "dash": [
          10,
          10
         ]
        }
       },
       {
        "id": "color",
        "value": {
         "mode": "fixed",
         "fixedColor": "text"
        }
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "options": {
    "legend": {
     "displayMode": "table",
     "placement": "right",
     "showLegend": true,
     "calcs": [
      "mean",
      "max"
     ],
     "sortBy": "Mean",
     "sortDesc": true
    },
    "tooltip": {
     "mode": "multi",
     "sort": "desc"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 16,
   "type": "table",
   "title": "Devices",
   "description": "Every device seen on `lan` since the nft `acct_lan` table was loaded, busiest first (by download over the dashboard's time range). **Now** columns are 3-minute rates.\n\n**In hosts.conf**: `NOT LISTED` means the MAC isn't in any dnsmasq `dhcp-host` line. Its name then comes from its DHCP lease hostname, or its vendor (IEEE registry), or the raw MAC. Add it to `/etc/dnsmasq.d/hosts.conf` to name it and pin its zone. `randomized MAC` vendors are phones/laptops using a private Wi-Fi address.",
   "datasource": "Prometheus",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 12,
    "w": 20,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 30
   },
   "links": [
    {
     "title": "LAN Devices: stacked throughput, filter by zone/device",
     "url": "/d/lan-devices"
    }
   ],
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "sum by (name, zone, vendor, tracked, mac) (rate(lan_device_download_bytes_total{tracked!=\"n/a\"}[3m])) * 8",
     "refId": "A",
     "instant": true,
     "format": "table"
    },
    {
     "expr": "sum by (name, zone, vendor, tracked, mac) (rate(lan_device_upload_bytes_total{tracked!=\"n/a\"}[3m])) * 8",
     "refId": "B",
     "instant": true,
     "format": "table"
    },
    {
     "expr": "sum by (name, zone, vendor, tracked, mac) (increase(lan_device_download_bytes_total{tracked!=\"n/a\"}[$__range]))",
     "refId": "C",
     "instant": true,
     "format": "table"
    },
    {
     "expr": "sum by (name, zone, vendor, tracked, mac) (increase(lan_device_upload_bytes_total{tracked!=\"n/a\"}[$__range]))",
     "refId": "D",
     "instant": true,
     "format": "table"
    }
   ],
   "transformations": [
    {
     "id": "merge",
     "options": {}
    },
    {
     "id": "organize",
     "options": {
      "excludeByName": {
       "Time": true
      },
      "indexByName": {
       "name": 0,
       "tracked": 1,
       "zone": 2,
       "Value #A": 3,
       "Value #B": 4,
       "Value #C": 5,
       "Value #D": 6,
       "vendor": 7,
       "mac": 8
      },
      "renameByName": {
       "name": "Device",
       "tracked": "In hosts.conf",
       "zone": "Zone",
       "Value #A": "Down now",
       "Value #B": "Up now",
       "Value #C": "Down (range)",
       "Value #D": "Up (range)",
       "vendor": "Vendor",
       "mac": "MAC"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "sortBy",
     "options": {
      "sort": [
       {
        "field": "Down (range)",
        "desc": true
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "custom": {
      "align": "auto",
      "filterable": true,
      "cellOptions": {
       "type": "auto"
      }
     }
    },
    "overrides": [
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "Down now"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "unit",
        "value": "bps"
       },
       {
        "id": "decimals",
        "value": 1
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "Up now"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "unit",
        "value": "bps"
       },
       {
        "id": "decimals",
        "value": 1
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "Down (range)"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "unit",
        "value": "bytes"
       },
       {
        "id": "decimals",
        "value": 1
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "Up (range)"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "unit",
        "value": "bytes"
       },
       {
        "id": "decimals",
        "value": 1
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "In hosts.conf"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "mappings",
        "value": [
         {
          "type": "value",
          "options": {
           "yes": {
            "text": "yes",
            "color": "green",
            "index": 0
           },
           "no": {
            "text": "NOT LISTED",
            "color": "orange",
            "index": 1
           }
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "id": "custom.cellOptions",
        "value": {
         "type": "color-text"
        }
       },
       {
        "id": "custom.width",
        "value": 120
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "Zone"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "custom.width",
        "value": 100
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "MAC"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "custom.width",
        "value": 150
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "options": {
    "showHeader": true,
    "cellHeight": "sm",
    "footer": {
     "show": false
    }
   }
